                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="community-content">
                    <span class="section-tag">Peer Networking</span>
                    <h2 class="section-title">Campus Life Is Better Together.</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        Discover communities, meet new people, share your ideas, and participate in experiences that go beyond the classroom.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="community-checklist">
                        <li>
                            <div class="checklist-icon">
                                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#10b981"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                            </div>
                            <span><strong>Cross-Disciplinary Teams:</strong> Team up with engineers, designers, and business students for campus initiatives.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <div class="checklist-icon">
                                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#10b981"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                            </div>
                            <span><strong>Mentorship &amp; Guidance:</strong> Connect with club alumni and seniors who have navigated internships and hackathons.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <div class="checklist-icon">
                                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#10b981"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                            </div>
                            <span><strong>Shared Passion Channels:</strong> Join interest-based discussions from competitive coding to robotics research.</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <div>
                        <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">
                            <span>Join the Community &rarr;</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================================================
         HOW IT WORKS SECTION (TIMELINE)
         ========================================================================== -->
    <section class="timeline-section" id="how-it-works">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-tag">Simple Journey</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">
                    Get plugged into your campus pulse in four intuitive, friction-free steps.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-wrapper">
                <div class="timeline-line"></div>
                <div class="timeline-grid">
                    
                    <div class="timeline-step">
                        <div class="step-node">01</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h3>Discover</h3>
                            <p>Explore upcoming events and student clubs with smart campus filters.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="timeline-step">
                        <div class="step-node">02</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h3>Connect</h3>
                            <p>Find communities and students with shared interests, goals and passions.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="timeline-step">
                        <div class="step-node">03</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h3>Participate</h3>
                            <p>Register for events with 1-click passes and become an active member.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="timeline-step">
                        <div class="step-node">04</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h3>Experience</h3>
                            <p>Build lasting connections, unlock real skills, and make unforgettable memories.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================================================
