                    </p>
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517841905240-472988babdf9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover;" alt="Student avatar">
